[[9516,3627,"There was a lack of clear policies and procedure about how a patient under a section should be transferred and what documentation / resource should go with them.","lack of clear policies and procedure for transferring patients under a section",""],[9517,3627,"There was a recognition on 17.2.21 by Kendray Hospital that NG tube feeding was required.","delay in inserting NG tube after recognition of need",""],[9518,3627,"Barnsley Hospital did not initially feel transfer should take place to them and it was not until 23.6.21 that they accepted a transfer","delay in accepting patient transfer",""],[9519,3627,"Despite recognising an NG tube was required, one was not inserted until the 30.6.21","delayed insertion of NG tube",""]]